  "schematicNotes": [
    {
      "id": "n_intro",
      "text": "ENGINE ROOM HARNESS C - PARTIAL. Only new / upgraded / relocated feeds. Do not redraw the OEM engine-room, cowl or dash looms. Kick-panel J/B No.1, R/B No.2 / No.3 / No.4 stay. Unplug engine-bay J/B No.2 and F11; inject at the pins in the splice table (docs/electrical/ENGINE-ROOM-POWER-REDISTRIBUTION.md).",
      "width": 390,
      "schematicPosition": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": -1400
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "n_heavy",
      "text": "HEAVY DC: trunk battery -> cabin PDB (glove box) -> RADLOK 5.7 mm through the firewall -> starter B+. 160 A alt B+ joins the starter post and does not recross. Jump lugs at trunk battery, PDB, starter, engine block, and the engine-bay jump post. 2 AWG is OK for cranking; 160 A continuous charge may need 1/0 + 8 mm RADLOK - see the table.",
      "width": 390,
      "schematicPosition": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": -1140
      },
      "color": "Orange"
    },
    {
      "id": "n_split",
      "text": "EPS 12 V / GND ride the passenger fender in the vacated ABS actuator space. Fans ride the core-support run of the OEM engine-room main. A/C compressor clutch stays on engine harness A/B (Power/Signal files). Crash sensors and ABS solenoid are deleted - do not refeed 60A FL ABS, A7/A8, A11/A12, A37.",
      "width": 390,
      "schematicPosition": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": -880
      },
      "color": "Green"
    },
    {
      "id": "shdr_0",
      "text": "TRUNK + GLOVE BOX",
      "width": 270,
      "schematicPosition": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": -620
      },
      "color": "Green"
    },
    {
      "id": "shdr_1",
      "text": "FIREWALL RADLOK",
      "width": 270,
      "schematicPosition": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": -360
      },
      "color": "Orange"
    },
    {
      "id": "n_probe",
      "text": "PROBE BEFORE CRIMPING 2E-2 / 2E-3. Starting + ignition (EWD p.48) puts AM1 on 2E-2/2E-5 and AM2 on 2E-3/2E-6, then IE1-10 / IE1-17. Inner circuit (p.21) puts 30A RTR on 2E-2 and 15A HAZ-HORN on 2E-3. If the unplugged 2E-2 shows continuity to IE1-10, that pin is AM1 - do not land PMU O5 there. Same for 2E-3 vs IE1-17 / AM2. HEAD 2A-3/2A-6 and DOME 2E-4 do not sit on that pass-through. Horn fallback is R/B5.",
      "width": 390,
      "schematicPosition": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": -100
      },
      "color": "Red"
    },
    {
      "id": "shdr_2",
      "text": "OEM INJECTION (keep J/Bs)",
      "width": 390,
      "schematicPosition": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 160
      },
      "color": "Red"
    },
    {
      "id": "shdr_3",
      "text": "NEW ENGINE-ROOM LOADS",
      "width": 270,
      "schematicPosition": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 420
      },
      "color": "Blue"
    }
  ],
